        "eyebrow": "Highlights",
        "heading": "<em>Six reasons</em> it earns its shelf.",
        "text": "<p>Ritual Serum No. 01 was formulated backwards — from how skin feels at the end of the day, to the molecules that get it there.</p>",
        "benefits": [
          {
            "icon": "drop",
            "title": "72-hour hydration",
            "text": "A lipid-mimicking veil of ceramide NP, squalane and glacial water holds moisture through three full days."
          },
          {
            "icon": "flask",
            "title": "Small-batch craft",
            "text": "Blended in Grasse in batches of 400, cold-filled into recyclable glass and numbered by hand."
          },
          {
            "icon": "sparkles",
            "title": "Soft-focus finish",
            "text": "Micronised pigment diffuses light across the skin — luminous in daylight, never glittering under flash."
          },
          {
            "icon": "hours",
            "title": "12-hour wear",
            "text": "Transfer-resistant through coffee, calls and closing hours. Removes cleanly with a single cleanse."
          },
          {
            "icon": "leaf",
            "title": "Clean by omission",
            "text": "No silicones, sulphates, parabens or mineral oil. Vegan, cruelty-free, Leaping Bunny certified."
          },
          {
